  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl mix together the basil, diced tomatoes, garlic, olives, olive oil, salt, pepper, chives, sun dried tomatoes, and red pepper chile flakes. Cover and place in refrigerator for a few hours or overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove sauce from refrigerator 2 hours before serving, to allow ingredients to come to room temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large pot with boiling salted water cook farfalle pasta until al dente. Drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
